{"sourceUrl":"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/tzgg3/af7d1d8afa0946d9a0a93b9274d681ba.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:59.377380+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/tzgg3/af7d1d8afa0946d9a0a93b9274d681ba.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>为促进全国优秀大学生加深对我系教学、科研及人才培养等方面的了解，</span><span>我系</span><span>定于202</span><span>6</span><span>年7月举办</span><span>“</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年全国优秀大学生暑期网上</span><span>交流</span><span>”</span><span>活动，现将活动</span><span>内容</span><span>公布如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>一、报名条件</span></p>\n<p><span>1. 拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德端正，遵纪守法，在校期间无学术不端行为，无违纪表现。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. 勤奋好学，思维敏捷，有较强的创新意识、创新能力。有希望获得所在学校推免资格的优秀本科三年级在校生（202</span><span>7</span><span>年应届本科毕业生）。</span></p>\n<p><span>3. 本科专业应为电气工程类。另外，为进一步加强学科交叉研究，欢迎工学门类下的机械类（0802）、材料类（0804）、能源动力类（0805）、电子信息类（0807）、自动化类（0808）、计算机类（0809），以及理学门类下的数学类（0701）、物理学类（0702）相关专业同学参加交叉学科专项计划学术交流（学生在所学专业的综合考察成绩位于前10%）</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>4. 英语要求：具有良好的英语应用能力，CET4</span><span>≥</span><span>425或TOEFL</span><span>≥</span><span>90或IELTS</span><span>≥</span><span>6.0。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>二、报名须知</span></p>\n<p><span>1. 请登录电力工程系研究生招生服务系统进行注册报名：</span><a href=\"http://59.67.225.29/zs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://59.67.225.29/zs/</span></a><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. 报名时间：202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span><span>-7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span><span>下</span><span>午14:30</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>. </span><span>线上宣讲时间：预计</span><span>7月8日8:30，</span><span>通过线上</span><span>腾讯</span><span>会议的形式</span><span>进行。</span><span>届时将对</span><span>我系</span><span>总体</span><span>情况</span><span>进行介绍、对</span><span>交叉学科专项计划政策进行解读，各团队代表老师将</span><span>进行科研团队宣讲</span><span>。</span><span>会议号及具体安排，将于7月7日在电力工程系官网主页和学术交流通知群公布</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span>. </span><span>个人材料上传时间：</span><span>7月8日8:00-7</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日</span><span>23:59</span><span>，</span><span>学生可</span><span>按照《</span><span>学员</span><span>须知》提供个人风采相关材料，与导师</span><span>线上</span><span>互动。</span><span>我系将根据上传材料和与导师沟通情况推荐</span><span>“</span><span>优秀学员</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span>为了方便联系，</span><span>我系</span><span>建立了</span><span>“</span><span>电力工程系</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>学术交流通知</span><span>群</span><span>”</span><span>（群二维码如下）</span><span>,</span><span>后续通知</span><span>也</span><span>将在群内发布</span><span>（</span><span>包括参与交叉学科学术交流的导师及研究方向等</span><span>）。</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-07/f77920a5d11445f4a6b47c20b127e75b.png\" title=\"\"/><br/></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>6</span><span>. 相关信息请关注我系网站通知公告：</span><a href=\"http://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/</span></a><span>。导师信息除招生服务系统外，还可通过我系师资队伍网页了解https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/szdw/szdwjj/index.htm。</span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span>. 信息咨询电话：0312-7522581。</span></p>\n<p><span></span><span>                                                  电力工程系</span></p>\n<p><span>                                                                                                                        </span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>附件：报名系统说明</span></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-07/f7fb57595abe4192819ee3e3757da142.png\"/><br/><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-07/dffd3e248f284047b8e6c3f7d0b03683.png\"/><br/><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-07/cecd914489d348a2a989d5b040a8619f.png\"/><br/></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-07/5252b0f47a494c54bf716f48d426e89f.png\"/><br/><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-07/74869130eccc46c4ad1c6322948be791.png\"/><br/></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-07/75f2a978e8a34491acc10fb62a37e164.png\"/><br/></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2026-07/217ec0d9272e43498f80ab229e2869c8.png\"/><br/><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span><span>-7</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日上传个人材料，系统账号为：身份证号，初始密码为身份证号后六位</span><span>。登陆后，请及时更改密码。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span><span> </span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"bf766d6dc9c5a2b67eda1c6e478dd089886188b8865ef7b4fa939ac71b2620c2","textLength":1007,"sourceSha256":"7c52e20ef17d56d9681e72796ad7b704c3fd36e716e12f9373cb1a2765f56e54","selector":"article-like:gp-article1 gp-article gp-f16","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0d18635a30d7c307131d","title":"2026年华北电力大学电力工程系2026年全国优秀大学生暑期网上学术交流活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:59.377380+00:00"}
